ide. By taking a strategic and proactive approach to technology adoption, businesses can harness its full potential for growth and innovation.</p>', 'text', 'completed', 'private', NULL, NULL, '0.00', '2025-09-29 08:46:09', '2025-09-29 08:46:09', NULL, NULL, NULL),
