('78', '2', 'A hyper photorealistic 9:16 image of a mountain peak that was once an ancient eldritch stronghold.', '{"prompt":"A hyper photorealistic 9:16 image of a mountain peak that was once an ancient eldritch stronghold. At the summit stands a ruined alien-like castle, its twisted spires and arches built in impossible, otherworldly shapes. The architecture looks unnatural, almost alive, with jagged forms and strange patterns etched into the stone. Beneath the castle lie the skeletal remains of a colossal eldritch creature: its skull crowned with jagged horns, ribcage shattered, and countless tentacle-like bones sprawling across the mountain slopes. The bones are immense, weathered, and half-buried, draped in moss and vines. Near the skull and castle, the moss is a sickly green-black, unnatural and menacing in color, contrasting with the lighter greenery on the lower slopes. The ruins and skeleton are heavily overgrown with foliage, blending with the forested mountain as though nature has slowly reclaimed the site. The atmosphere is ominous yet awe-inspiring, a national park where tourists wander among paths and railings, dwarfed by the haunting remnants of this eldritch past.","model":"runware:97@2","width":1024,"height":768,"numberResults":2,"imageStyle":null,"name":"Image: dog and cat playing","share":false}', 'image', 'completed', 'public', '{"runware_response":{"data":[{"taskType":"imageInference","imageUUID":"837ffc07-3d71-4cf9-a0fe-00ac82fe6417","taskUUID":"762b928d-2126-4596-b796-163c4a33ad1c","cost":0,"seed":2681885227,"imageURL":"https:\/\/im.runware.ai\/image\/ws\/2\/ii\/837ffc07-3d71-4cf9-a0fe-00ac82fe6417.jpg"},{"taskType":"imageInference","imageUUID":"74cc8811-2b5f-4949-8593-0c0a478392b6","taskUUID":"762b928d-2126-4596-b796-163c4a33ad1c","cost":0,"seed":2681885228,"imageURL":"https:\/\/im.runware.ai\/image\/ws\/2\/ii\/74cc8811-2b5f-4949-8593-0c0a478392b6.jpg"}]},"task_id":"762b928d-2126-4596-b796-163c4a33ad1c"}', NULL, '30.00', '2025-10-07 08:37:37'